<!--
  SPEC.md 4.4a - abilities for batch three: Drain Vitality, Dismay, Cyclone.

  All three are ordinary targeted cone shouts inheriting Dovahkiin_ShoutBase, so none of them
  hits the no-target trap that broke Clear Skies and batch two. They reuse the travelling wave
  and differ only in data.

  Icons are placeholders and are all ROYALTY, never Biotech. The baseline environment is
  Core + Royalty + Ideology with Biotech optional at runtime, and a Biotech icon path shows the
  missing-texture square on a legal baseline install. See ART_TODO.md.
-->
<Defs>

  <!-- ================= Drain Vitality ================= -->
  <!--
    No direct damage at all. The entire effect is the Dovahkiin_VitalityDrained hediff, whose
    severity IS the shout level, and HediffComp_DrainNeeds reads that severity to decide how
    much of the victim to take:
      1  stamina (RimWorld of Magic, if present) + Rest
      2  adds magicka (if present) + Joy
      3  adds health, capped at 12 applications
    The magic mod is recommended, never required. See the hediff def and COMPAT.md section 5.
  -->

